Scriptorium is a fork of Calibre-Web-Automated. It replaces the web interface
(templates, styles and scripts) and keeps the backend, the automation services
and the data formats of the upstream projects. Files changed or written for
Scriptorium carry an additional "Copyright (C) 2026 Mrcoloo" line; every
original copyright notice is kept.

